---
name: Naked & Shameless
ingredients:
  - type: Mezcal
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Genepy
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lime juice
    amount: 3/4
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Aperol
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Papaya juice
    amount: 1/2
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Mint
    amount: '1'
    unit: sprig
    garnish: false
category:
  - tequila
image: ../../images/cocktails/naked-and-shameless/image.jpg
sourceUrl: https://www.foodandwine.com/naked-and-shameless-7511263
---
1. Add mezcal, Genepy, lime juice, Aperol, and papaya juice to a cocktail shaker filled with ice. Shake until combined.
1. Strain into a rocks glass over one ice cube. Garnish with mint sprig.
